an><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かいがん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">海岸；海滨；滨海；海边；沙滩</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"185047\"><ruby>海岸<rp>(</rp><rt>かいがん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にはほとんど<ruby>人<rp>(</rp><rt>ひと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がいなかった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">海岸上几乎没有人。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">階級</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かいきゅう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">（社会）阶级；阶层；等级；级别；品级</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">海峡</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かいきょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">海峡；水道</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"211749\">その<ruby>海峡<rp>(</rp><rt>かいきょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>長<rp>(</rp><rt>なが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>橋<rp>(</rp><rt>はし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>建設中<rp>(</rp><rt>けんせつちゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>です。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">沿海正在建造一座长的桥梁。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">会議</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かいぎ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">会议；集会；大会；理事会；代表大会；国会</span></div><div cla