<rp>(</rp><rt>かいけつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>されていない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这个问题尚未解决。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">会見</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かいけん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">会见；会面；接见；观影会</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"137489\"><ruby>大臣<rp>(</rp><rt>だいじん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>記者団<rp>(</rp><rt>きしゃだん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>との<ruby>会見<rp>(</rp><rt>かいけん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>拒<rp>(</rp><rt>こば</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>んだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他拒绝与记者会面。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">介護</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かいご</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">护理；照护；看护；护理服务</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">会合</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かいごう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">会面；集会；聚集；（化学）缔合；（天体的）合</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"109074\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>会合<rp>(</rp><rt>かいごう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>出<rp>(</rp><rt>で</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たり<ruby>出<rp>(</rp><rt>で</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>なかったりだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他不去或不去见面。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">開催</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かいさい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">举办；举行；召开；主办</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"78377\"><ruby>理事会<rp>(</rp><rt>りじかい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>開催<rp>(</rp><rt>かいさい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しなければならない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">必须召开理事会。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">改札</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かいさつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">检票；查票；检票口；检票闸口</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">解散</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かいさん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">散会；解散（会议、集会等）；解散；清算；遣散；分裂（公司、组织等）；解散（议会、国会等）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"148404\"><ruby>首相<rp>(</rp><rt>しゅしょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>国会<rp>(</rp><rt>こっかい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>解散<rp>(</rp><rt>かいさん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">总理解散了国会。</span></div></li>"]